            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng The Local2",
            "review_text": "Andrew\nMoscow, Russia96 contributions\n0\nReally delicious🍜\nJul 2025 • Couples\nI recommend this restaurant as the best price/quality ratio.\nThe establishment is located on a busy tourist street in the European Quarter, near the Green Beach, Poseidon, Vinpearl Beachfront hotels. \nAt the entrance, hostess Anya or her assistant are welcomed. The staff understands Russian. There are fans in the room. The restaurant itself consists of two floors. Also located at the entrance are aquariums with inhabitants of the sea. You are taken out and advised on how best/tastiest to cook. There is no seafood on ice and it is an indicator of exceptional freshness (a live type of future food). \nPrices are very democratic compared to restaurants nearby. \nBesides seafood, Vietnamese cuisine is offered in large portions, cold frets, coconut. There is alcohol, but I'm not interested. \nIn general, owners and staff have the main goal - to welcome the guest soulfully and deliciously feed him! So I recommend a restaurant for a must-see.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten July 17, 2025",
